Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.88,JP,,0,0,0,,お友達が来た！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.88,VI,,0,0,0,,Các bạn đến rồi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.02,0:00:05.34,JP,,0,0,0,,ペッパのお友達。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.02,0:00:05.34,VI,,0,0,0,,Các bạn của Peppa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.34,0:00:06.50,JP,,0,0,0,,猫のキャンディ、
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.34,0:00:06.50,VI,,0,0,0,,Mèo Candy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:07.42,JP,,0,0,0,,羊のスージー、
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.50,0:00:07.42,VI,,0,0,0,,Cừu Suzy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.42,0:00:08.34,JP,,0,0,0,,犬のダニー、
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.42,0:00:08.34,VI,,0,0,0,,Chó Danny,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:09.36,JP,,0,0,0,,ウサギのレベッカ
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.34,0:00:09.36,VI,,0,0,0,,Thỏ Rebecca
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.36,0:00:10.58,JP,,0,0,0,,とポニーのペドロです。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.36,0:00:10.58,VI,,0,0,0,,và ngựa nhỏ Pedro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.58,0:00:11.86,JP,,0,0,0,,みんな、いらっしゃい。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.58,0:00:11.86,VI,,0,0,0,,Chào các con, vào đi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.86,0:00:13.06,JP,,0,0,0,,ハッピーバースデー、ペッパ。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.86,0:00:13.06,VI,,0,0,0,,Chúc mừng sinh nhật, Peppa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.76,0:00:15.84,JP,,0,0,0,,さあ、みんな。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.76,0:00:15.84,VI,,0,0,0,,Nào, các con.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.84,0:00:17.20,JP,,0,0,0,,パーティーの始まりよ。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.84,0:00:17.20,VI,,0,0,0,,Bữa tiệc bắt đầu rồi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.82,0:00:22.82,JP,,0,0,0,,ダディピッグがマジックショーを始めます。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.82,0:00:22.82,VI,,0,0,0,,Bố Heo bắt đầu buổi ảo thuật.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.64,0:00:26.02,JP,,0,0,0,,ペッパ、なんて言うか覚えてる？
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.64,0:00:26.02,VI,,0,0,0,,Peppa, con nhớ phải nói gì không?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:28.08,JP,,0,0,0,,皆さん、ご注目。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.70,0:00:28.08,VI,,0,0,0,,Mọi người chú ý.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.08,0:00:32.06,JP,,0,0,0,,こちらがマジシャン、アメイジングミステリオだ。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.08,0:00:32.06,VI,,0,0,0,,Đây là ảo thuật gia, Mysterio Kỳ Diệu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.06,0:00:33.08,JP,,0,0,0,,分かった、ダディ。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.06,0:00:33.08,VI,,0,0,0,,Con hiểu rồi, bố.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.02,0:00:35.78,JP,,0,0,0,,皆さん、ご注目。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.02,0:00:35.78,VI,,0,0,0,,Mọi người chú ý.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.93,0:00:44.73,JP,,0,0,0,,まずはこのマジックから。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.93,0:00:44.73,VI,,0,0,0,,Trước tiên là trò ảo thuật này.
